   "QUESTION_DESC": "<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif\">In a BST implemented using a linked list, what happens if we try to delete a node that has only one child?</span></span></span></b></p>\n",
