   "QUESTION_DESC": "<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>You are developing a student record management system for a university. Each student record contains a unique ID number, and you need to store these IDs in a data structure that allows:</b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Fast insertion when a new student registers,</b></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Search operation to check if a student ID already exists,</b></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Deletion of a record when a student withdraws.</b></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>To handle this efficiently, implement a Binary Search Tree using linked list in C language where each node represents a student ID.</b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Tasks:</b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Define the structure of a node in the BST using a linked list.</b></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Write functions in C for:</b></span></span></span></span>\n\t<ul style=\"list-style-type:circle\">\n\t\t<li style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 72.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Inserting a new student ID into the BST.</b></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t\t<li style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 72.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Searching for a specific student ID.</b></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t\t<li style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 72.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Deleting a student ID from the BST.</b></span></span></span></span></li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-bottom:11px; margin-left:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Perform the following operations in order:</b></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ol>\n\n<ul style=\"list-style-type:circle\">\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:8px; margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Insert the student IDs: 101, 85, 120, 70, 90, 110, 130</b></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:8px; margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Search for student ID 90</b></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:8px; margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Delete student ID 85</b></span></span></span></li>\n\t<li style=\"margin-left:8px; margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><b>Display the tree in in-order traversal after deletion</b></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
